udy in one calendar at the start of the week, so a crowded day is no surprise.\"},{\"title\":\"Study in short blocks\",\"body\":\"Forty-five minutes of focused work, then a real break, suits most people better than one long sitting.\"},{\"title\":\"Test yourself\",\"body\":\"Close the book and try to recall the main points. Remembering an idea strengthens it more than reading it again.\"},{\"title\":\"Ask for help early\",\"body\":\"If something does not make sense, ask your teaching team sooner rather than later.\"}]"},{"id":"v2b1boo1z82ix","name":"open","type":"list","initial":"[0]"}],"scripts":[],"assets":[],"fonts":[],"dataSources":[],"settings":{"startArtboardId":"ab2b1bo1vze5t2","fit":"contain","pageBackground":"#111111","title":"Study habits","description":"","scriptSandbox":true,"optimiseOutput":true,"optimiseLevel":4},"themes":{"list":[{"id":"theme-light","name":"Light","mode":"light"},{"id":"theme-dark","name":"Dark","mode":"dark"},{"id":"theme-high-contrast","name":"High contrast","mode":"dark","highContrast":true}],"tokens":[{"id":"tk2b1bo3n7zily","name":"color/background","values":{"theme-light":"#fefefe","theme-dark":"#1e1e1e","theme-high-contrast":"#1e1e1e"},"palette":{"theme-light":"--ilar-swatch-off-white","theme-dark":"--ilar-swatch-grey-7","theme-high-contrast":"--ilar-swatch-grey-7"}},{"id":"tk2b1bo492bx5r","name":"color/surface","values":{"theme-light":"#f4f4f4","theme-dark":"#333333","theme-high-contrast":"#1e1e1e"},"palette":{"theme-light":"--ilar-swatch-grey-1","theme-dark":"--ilar-swatch-grey-text","theme-high-contrast":"--ilar-swatch-grey-7"}},{"id":"tk2b1bo5r5hxb1","name":"color/surface-muted","values":{"theme-light":"#dfdfdf","theme-dark":"#4d4d4d","theme-high-contrast":"#4d4d4d"},"palette":{"theme-light":"--ilar-swatch-grey-2","theme-dark":"--ilar-swatch-grey-6","theme-high-contrast":"--ilar-swatch-grey-6"}},{"id":"tk2b1bo6h2hwfn","name":"color/text","values":{"theme-light":"#1e1e1e","theme-dark":"#f4f4f4","theme-high-contrast":"#fefefe"